<div class="page-hero">
    <div class="section-label">FAQ</div>
    <h1>Frequently asked questions</h1>
    <p>Everything you need to know about placing an order. Can't find your answer? <a href="/contact/" style="color: var(--accent);">Contact us directly.</a></p>
</div>

<section class="section alt-bg">
    <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="section-header">
            <div class="section-label">Ordering</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">Placing an order</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question">
                    Is there a minimum order quantity?
                    <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>No minimum for personal orders — we accept single-piece requests. For institutional or bulk orders, volume pricing kicks in from 50 units. Contact us for a tailored quote.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question">
                    How do I place an order?
                    <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>You can place an order through our <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>, by emailing <a href="mailto:jackiemagulu@gmail.com">jackiemagulu@gmail.com</a>, or by messaging us directly on WhatsApp at +256 783 169770. We'll confirm specifications and send a quote within 24 hours.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question">
                    Can I provide my own design or logo?
                    <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes. Send us your logo or design in any common format (PNG, JPG, PDF, or AI). For embroidery, higher-resolution files produce the best results. We'll confirm compatibility before production begins.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question">
                    Do you provide samples before bulk production?
                    <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes, for bulk orders we can produce a sample piece for approval before full production. Sample costs are credited toward the final order amount.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-header" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
            <div class="section-label">Production</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">Turnaround &amp; production</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question">
                    How long does production take?
                    <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Turnaround depends on quantity and complexity. Personal orders typically take 3–7 working days. Bulk institutional orders (100+ units) typically take 2–4 weeks. We'll confirm your specific deadline when quoting.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question">
                    Can you handle urgent orders?
                    <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>We do our best to accommodate rush orders depending on current capacity. Contact us as early as possible and we'll let you know if we can meet your deadline.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question">
                    What materials do you use?
                    <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>We use premium acrylic, wool-blend, and cotton yarns depending on the intended use. Institutional uniforms typically use durable acrylic blends for longevity. We'll recommend the best material for your specific needs.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-header" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
            <div class="section-label">Payment &amp; delivery</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">Pricing &amp; delivery</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question">
                    How do I pay?
                    <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>We accept Mobile Money (MTN and Airtel), bank transfer, and cash. A 50% deposit is required to begin production, with the balance due on collection or before delivery.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question">
                    Do you deliver?
                    <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes. We can arrange delivery anywhere in Uganda. Delivery costs depend on location and quantity. You can also collect from our Gayaza or Kampala offices at no charge.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question">
                    What is your returns or correction policy?
                    <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>If we make an error against the agreed specifications, we'll correct or replace the affected items at no cost. We ask that you inspect items within 7 days of collection or delivery and notify us of any issues promptly.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="cta-strip">
    <h2>Still have questions?</h2>
    <p>Our team is happy to help — reach us on WhatsApp or email.</p>
